docs {
  ## Delete Category — In Use (Conflict)

  Tests the safe-delete behavior when a category is referenced by gigs or jobs.
  Replace `CATEGORY_WITH_GIGS_OR_JOBS_UUID` with a category UUID that has active gigs/jobs.

  ### Expected Response (409 Conflict)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "Category is in use and cannot be deleted",
    "data": {
      "references": {
        "gigs": 2,
        "jobs": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
